  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_type\": \"CEFR Englisl Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\nThe rise of artificial intelligence (AI) has led to a significant shift in the way we perceive and utilize technology. While some see it as an opportunity for efficiency and progress, others express concerns about its potential impact on job markets and personal freedom. AI is now integrated into various aspects of our daily lives – from smartphones to self-driving cars – making it essential for individuals to understand its capabilities and limitations.\\n\\\nAI technology has the potential to revolutionize industries such as healthcare, finance, and transportation by improving decision-making processes, enhancing data analysis, and reducing human errors. However, it also raises ethical questions about privacy, security, and the role of humans in a world dominated by machines.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is the main topic of this passage?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"The impact of AI on job markets\",\n        \"The future of transportation technology\",\n        \"Privacy concerns in the digital age\",\n        \"AI's role in healthcare advancements\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"The impact of AI on job markets\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"According to the passage, how does AI contribute to decision-making processes?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"It eliminates human errors\",\n        \"It replaces all human involvement\",\n        \"It prioritizes personal freedom over efficiency\",\n        \"It enhances data analysis capabilities\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"It enhances data analysis capabilities\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following statements is true about AI's impact on industries?\"